msgctxt "96"
msgid "Well, time to head in."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "120"
msgid "Oof!"
msgstr "Uff!"

msgctxt "144"
msgid "Oh, I'm sorry!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid ""
"Another one of Tamashiro's grunts, huh? Do I need to teach\r\n"
"you a lesson, too?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid "Wait, please."
msgstr "Aspetti, vi prego!"

msgctxt "180"
msgid "Just look at me! Do I seem like a yakuza to you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "You have a point. But you do look familiar..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid ""
"Anyway, if you're not with the Tamashiro, what are you doing\r\n"
"walking into their office?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid ""
"Well I have a, uh... deal to make with them. You know how it\r\n"
"is. I mean, you're obviously yakuza."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid ""
"Not anymore, I'm not. I'm just here to take care of some\r\n"
"business."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr "Oh..."

msgctxt "264"
msgid "Well, I'm Kamiyama. What's your name?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "276"
msgid "It's Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "288"
msgid "Kiryu-san... Why does it feel like I know that name?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "300"
msgid ""
"Anyway, I deal in certain... choice items. They've been in\r\n"
"high demand lately, if I do say so myself."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "312"
msgid ""
"It sounds like the Tamashiro are going to war soon, so they\r\n"
"asked me to bring some of my stuff over."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "324"
msgid "And let me guess, by \"stuff\" you mean weapons?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "336"
msgid ""
"You don't have to scream! The whole town's gonna hear!\r\n"
"But... if you're gonna go toe-to-toe with the Tamashiro,\r\n"
"I might be able to lend a hand, if you catch my drift."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "348"
msgid "I thought they were one of your customers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "360"
msgid ""
"Well yeah, but they're one of those customers you wish you\r\n"
"could get rid of, but can't because they pay your rent."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "372"
msgid ""
"Though if you started buying from me and wiped them out,\r\n"
"I could finally be free from their clutches!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "384"
msgid ""
"Hold on a second. I never said a word about wiping anyone\r\n"
"out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "396"
msgid ""
"No need to be coy about it. I've been in this business for\r\n"
"a looong time."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "408"
msgid ""
"Ripped guys like you are the brawling type. It's obvious.\r\n"
"You've probably been in more fights than I can count."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "420"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "432"
msgid ""
"Either way, wouldn't you rather have a weapon on you when\r\n"
"you bust in there? Better that than going in empty-handed!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "444"
msgid "I guess."
msgstr "Forse."

msgctxt "456"
msgid ""
"Then it's settled. I know the perfect store that can get\r\n"
"you just the fix you need."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "480"
msgid "That's it there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "492"
msgid "...Not much for appearances."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "504"
msgid "Don't worry about that. Just come with me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "540"
msgid "Looks like this is the place."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "552"
msgid ""
"I mean, yeah... but we're not really gonna walk in there by\r\n"
"ourselves, are we? They'll pulverize us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "564"
msgid "What, you scared?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "576"
msgid "Me? I'm not scared of a damn thing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "588"
msgid "I'd put my life on the line if you asked me to, Aniki!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "600"
msgid "Wait, that's..."
msgstr "Aspetta, quello è..."

msgctxt "624"
msgid "Saki's sketchbook."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "636"
msgid "This drawing is...!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "648"
msgid "Somethin' wrong, Aniki?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "660"
msgid ""
"We're definitely on the right track, Rikiya. Saki has to\r\n"
"be here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "672"
msgid "I knew it!"
msgstr "Lo sapevo!"

msgctxt "684"
msgid ""
"I want you to go get Nakahara and tell him we found her.\r\n"
"And bring him back with you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "696"
msgid "Um... okay! What about you, Aniki?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "708"
msgid "Just go! I'll keep an eye on things here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "720"
msgid "Okay! Be back in a jiff!"
msgstr ""

